        <span class="rounded-xl border border-v3-lime/30 bg-v3-lime/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-v3-lime">✓ MultiSport</span>
        <span class="rounded-xl border border-v3-lime/30 bg-v3-lime/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-v3-lime">✓ Medicover Sport</span>
        <span class="rounded-xl border border-v3-lime/30 bg-v3-lime/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-v3-lime">✓ Fit Profit</span>
